Calculator webApp 🧮

A simple and user-friendly calculator application that performs basic arithmetic operations.
This project is designed to demonstrate fundamental programming concepts and logical problem-solving.

🚀 Features

- Addition
- Subtraction
- Multiplication
- Division
- Clean and simple interface
- Fast and accurate calculations

🛠️ Tech Stack

- Python
- Basic programming logic
- HTML

▶️ How to Run the Project

1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/codingclone486/calculator-project.git

2. Navigate to the project folder

cd calculator-project

3. Run the program

python calculator.py

💡 Example Operations

Enter first number: 10
Enter operation (+, -, *, /): *
Enter second number: 5

Result: 50

